    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "I have seen your report."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Your achievements with Reunion are, to say the least, not worthy of commendation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "However, that being said, you have indeed procured some unexpectedly useful information."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Thank\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "No, there is no need for thanks. At least, not this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "You are all impressive warriors, and until your deaths, you are entitled to the rewards you've earned by virtue of the blood, sweat, and tears you have shed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "His Majesty the Regent knows well the acts and deeds of all Sarkaz, even those as insignificant as yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "The Infected are not the only thing in this temple gradually depreciating. Do you understand?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "If I am correct in my predictions, Rhodes Island has already welcomed the return of a certain unpalatable individual."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "And you... you should have made contact."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "(The Regent is even faster than W? All the way from Londinium?!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Mercenaries know loyalty only to their own interests. But that nonetheless makes a fine starting point."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "When the dust settles, and you stand once again before the throne of His Majesty\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "That is when you will receive your reward."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "And what about the other warriors?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "The young Infected has her own plans. Were you unaware?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "But His Majesty will not participate in such nonsense. We have mutually decided that Victoria will stand by and watch Reunion's next move."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "We lack 'effective measures' to retake control of that unit from W."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Furthermore, it is important that we, in the name of our supporters, continue to whip up the Infected in all corners of the world."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "We're still going to use Reunion? I was sure His Majesty would have..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Given up? Oh my no, young mercenary."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Things are yet far from chaotic enough. Even if Reunion has strayed from its leadership, it remains a source of chaos\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "What's more, should your words just now be taken as a question of His Majesty's intentions?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "No, absolutely not."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Very well. Raise your head..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Oh, yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "For the time being, you need not return to Kazdel. The journey back is too long, and matters have been progressing rapidly there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "You are to stay here, for now. Enjoy this small respite however you can."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Now then, His Majesty awaits me. You are dismissed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Remember, see to your own business first, Hoederer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
