        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Can you put a price on the life of a merc?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Sure. Always have. Why even ask? You knew the answer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "But who set the price?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "The war itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Sure... you got your battlefield honors, your victories, the glory you pull out of a hand-to-hand fight, all the things that raise your profile, that let everybody know what a useful tool you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So boring."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "But that's all in the past. At least for us it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Every Sarkaz merc should have a nice, clean price tag."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "But we don't need anybody to slap it on. No oversight. They write their own price in the blood of the enemies of Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "You... are you saying we should get everyone to leave Kazdel...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You look surprised. But like, they could choose for themselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Does this sound weird?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Not weird, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Just give it some thought... think about what you could be doing in Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "You're talking about doing that right in front of Theresis, in broad daylight."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You make it sound so bad. As if you don't have your own plans."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "......."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Chill... you were my boss, Hoederer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You'd better do it, or we'll have trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
