    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "That's a pretty good joke. The old hands at the Scar Market would laugh themselves into a coma."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "It certainly wouldn't make the committee happy. They'd be out a lotta money, and a lotta wasted brainpower."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "Not to mention all the people they killed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Sure enough... and the old hands there too... some of them are almost friends of ours..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "So what are you gonna do now? It's up to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Well... I can't leave Londinium. Hell, I can't even leave this mansion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "I think it's up to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "You can do a lot as a 'Messenger.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "'Keep following Talulah's orders. Hoederer isn't coming back yet.' Should be good?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "As long as that comms station still works, we'll hear back. And they'll get word to W."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "I know how to do this."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger",
        "text": "Don't give me orders."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
